+      counter_dz_mm    counter + mat + bins + objects raised (pelvis z); the policy keeps the nominal counter height
+      pp_px [cx, cy]   render the head image with this principal point (Isaac centres it at (w-1)/2, (h-1)/2,
+                       ignoring calibration.yaml cx/cy); each entry scalar | [lo, hi] | {mean, std}
